# Implementation Plan - Premium Sliding Auth Overhaul

The functionality of the sliding panel is approved. This plan focuses on "Aesthetic Excellence" to transform the current layout into a truly premium, high-end interface using "cards-within-cards" and refined glassy effects.

## Proposed Changes

### [Visual Style & Theme]
- **Premium Glassmorphism**: Use multi-layered shadows and subtle border-gradients (via `border-image` or pseudo-elements) to give the cards depth.
- **High-Contrast Typography**: Increase font sizes for headers and ensure all text has a minimum contrast ratio of 7:1 against backgrounds.
- **Mesh Gradients**: Enhance the sliding panel's background with a dynamic mesh gradient (Blue/Purple/Emerald) instead of a simple linear one.

### [Auth Components]

